Error [jet.CasingMismatch]: Constant `table` must be ALL_CAPS
  --> Tests/UI/comptime_step_limit_lowercase_binding_names_a_constant.jet:11:1
    |
 11 | table: #run total(1000)
    | ^^^^^
 Why: Jet enforces PascalCase for type-like names, snake_case for value-like names, and ALL_CAPS (SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) for module-global constants
 Fix: Rename it to `TABLE`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0357
